// ATT&CK: T1562
// Tags: detection.threat_hunting
// Description: Detects AMSI bypass via AmsiScanBuffer patching or PowerShell reflection unload.
// False positives:
//   - legitimate PowerShell module loading
// References:
//   - https://entroprism.net
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/02019c7f616fa2b4879138907ad45880092bf5b9/rules/windows/process_creation/amsi_bypass_patch_amsi.dll_amsiscanbuffer__reflection_unload.yml
